<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Aracruz Celulose started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aracruz Celulose started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer started coverage of Aracruz Celulose SA as underperform, an Oppenheimer source said.</p>
